orte inteligente a qualquer momento do treinamento. Uma tecnologia criada para tornar o aprendizado mais acess\u00edvel, din\u00e2mico e envolvente.", "short_description": "Conhe\u00e7a o Assistente Virtual com IA da VRSchool."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_VRschool.png", "id": "1471508504488603", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604298355_1471508507821936_1033407612722260786_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tqT5JrsUUFoQ7kNvwGJx8LG&_nc_oc=AdoeeJCKy-f9rW8l7F4PmA7mH0fsWx7_16_Aisu-A7W2Rwpm9T7hCNSQkMF-S0uGvLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT4MWJZK1vCmO3rLZp2ieJR3cx9ZNqPcwJg5x0xE-30nw&oe=6AFB36E3"}, {"file_name": "logo_VRSCHOOL.png", "id": "1449776713259284", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1449776716592617_1673567406847786742_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tajdxh7jbfMQ7kNvwHrUQYT&_nc_oc=AdolsGTRL7UTCxB96gchKYBKltgESnrJlSTXimoN3-s4xQfxnuiheYZsXB9E3F7VWPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTLMRDLSTdr66lIW7ImYfx7SubR_RJwBdRa3E7DFr4N5A&oe=6AFB3EE9"}, {"file_name": "icone_512x512.png", "id": "1278444900874844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825415_1278444904208177_5391998273224680991_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KCgM8-g-C2wQ7kNvwGo0gdZ&_nc_oc=AdrpQHDA1ky-VnbYr1XmBEKIW736cNnFg_FcusDej5pNQK5aJ_d6XytwTRcWyPcpoGM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0bjv-3EzQGiM7DTbXs3xu_qyZSdEPiHwJlGn1WlMjoQ&oe=6AFB47A7"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900_VRSCHOOL.png", "id": "1205723428036141", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_1205723434702807_6234410236425090773_n